<title>ITALY: SOCCER-AC MILAN V ROSENBORG TEAMS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AC MILAN V ROSENBORG TEAMS.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teams for Wednesday's European Cup</p>
<p>Champions' League, group D match between AC Milan and Rosenborg:</p>
<p>AC Milan - 1-Sebastiano Rossi; 3-Paolo Maldini, 4-Demetrio</p>
<p>Albertini, 6-Franco Baresi, 10-Dejan Savicevic, 11-Alessandro</p>
<p>Costacurta, 14-Michael Reiziger, 15-Massimo Ambrosini,</p>
